### Update first posting
PUT http://localhost:5050/postings/{{first.response.body.$.id}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "from": "Іван",
  "to": "Олена",
  "content": "Документи оновлено",
  "deliveryType": "Department",
  "weight": 0.5,
  "width": 20,
  "height": 15,
  "depth": 2,
  "value": 100,
  "id": {{first.response.body.$.id}},
  "price": 20
}

### Get updated posting
GET http://localhost:5050/postings/{{first.response.body.$.id}}

### Delete first posting
DELETE http://localhost:5050/postings/{{first.response.body.$.id}}

### Get deleted posting
GET http://localhost:5050/postings/{{first.response.body.$.id}}
